  "title": "Fruit Pizza Even Better",
  "description": "Smooth cream cheese and fresh fruit sit atop a buttery cookie crust in this colorful fruit pizza dessert. The pineapple juice glaze makes a bright and sweet topping.",
  "authors": [
    "Kim Harper"
  ],
